---
import DocsLayout from '../../layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
---

<DocsLayout title="Creating and Managing Banners">
  <div class="docs-content">
    <h1>Creating and Managing Banners</h1>

    <h2>Banner Editor Interface</h2>
    <p>When editing a banner, you'll see:</p>

    <h3>1. Header Information - Left Side</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Banner title</li>
      <li>Auto-save indicator (changes save automatically)</li>
      <li>Last edited timestamp</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>2. Header Publishing - Right Side</h3>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Publish/Unpublish button</strong> - Control banner visibility on your store</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>3. Status Output Bar</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>A bar where the information about the status of your banner and useful instructions are displayed.</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>4. Preview Navigation</h3>
    <p><strong>Preview modes</strong> - Test your banner in different responsive views:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Large mode (Desktop)</li>
      <li>Medium mode (Tablet)</li>
      <li>Small mode (Mobile)</li>
    </ul>

    <p>Use arrow buttons (left/right) to navigate between slides, and navigation dots at the bottom for quick access to specific slides.</p>

    <div class="docs-note">
      <p><strong>Note:</strong> Always test your banners across all three responsive modes to ensure they look great on every device.</p>
    </div>

    <hr />

    <h2>Slide Management</h2>
    <p>Organize and control your slides with these actions:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Reorder</strong> - Drag and drop slides to rearrange</li>
      <li><strong>Hide/Show</strong> - Temporarily disable slides without deleting</li>
      <li><strong>Duplicate</strong> - Copy a slide for quick creation</li>
      <li><strong>Delete</strong> - Permanently remove a slide</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="docs-tip">
      <p><strong>Pro Tip:</strong> Use the hide/show feature to test different slide combinations without losing your work.</p>
    </div>

    <hr />

    <div class="mt-12 flex gap-4">
      <a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/docs/dashboard`} class="btn bg-gray-200 text-gray-700 hover:bg-gray-300">
        ← Previous: Main Dashboard
      </a>
      <a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/docs/slide-types`} class="btn btn-primary">
        Next: Slide Types →
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</DocsLayout>
